+# Migration from Engine Foundation v0.1 to v0.2
+
+## Keep
+
+- Adapter-first reuse principle.
+- 9 shared visual engines.
+- Canonical evidence states.
+- Human Flow core formulas.
+- Weather claim gate direction.
+- Regional cloud source direction.
+- Paid panel and NAS policy direction.
+
+## Replace or correct
+
+1. Replace the broad v0.1 P0 list with the 16 true foundation contracts.
+2. Separate Density Algorithm from DATA TOWER Renderer.
+3. Change Forecast -> Calibration dependency into a closed forecast/ground-truth/calibration loop.
+4. Replace region-only satellite selection with product/tile/time selection.
+5. Add terrain, country focus, antimeridian geometry and LOD foundations.
+6. Add canonical S3 signal lake, revision, watermark and backfill contracts.
+7. Add precip/runoff/river/flood separation.
+8. Add domain policy registry and rights/usage/quota contracts.
+9. Upgrade archive policy to a state machine, verification gate and restore plan.
+10. Add fail-soft scenes, trust ledger, observation-gap, cost-to-value and country passport.
+
+## Application rule
+
+Do not copy v0.1 and v0.2 modules into the repository simultaneously under competing imports. Apply v0.2 to a clean task branch and use the v8 compatibility adapter to reuse existing source files.
